{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0043", "speaker_id": "ilyra", "text": "Today earned it.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[EVENING — CROWN GUEST QUARTERS]", "source_speaker_label": "ILYRA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_REST_IN_CAELORA_MORNING_DEPARTURE_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 173}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0044", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "I was using that.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[EVENING — CROWN GUEST QUARTERS]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_REST_IN_CAELORA_MORNING_DEPARTURE_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 189}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0045", "speaker_id": "torren", "text": "Were.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[EVENING — CROWN GUEST QUARTERS]", "source_speaker_label": "TORREN", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_REST_IN_CAELORA_MORNING_DEPARTURE_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 191}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0046", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "Closing the cap does not alter the temporal status of the work.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[EVENING — CROWN GUEST QUARTERS]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_REST_IN_CAELORA_MORNING_DEPARTURE_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 193}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0047", "speaker_id": "torren", "text": "Did now.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[EVENING — CROWN GUEST QUARTERS]", "source_speaker_label": "TORREN", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_REST_IN_CAELORA_MORNING_DEPARTURE_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 195}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0048", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "That is not how tense works, and I refuse to lose a grammar argument to a man who annotates maps like punctuation costs money.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[EVENING — CROWN GUEST QUARTERS]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_REST_IN_CAELORA_MORNING_DEPARTURE_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 197}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0049", "speaker_id": "torren", "text": "Still closed.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[EVENING — CROWN GUEST QUARTERS]", "source_speaker_label": "TORREN", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_REST_IN_CAELORA_MORNING_DEPARTURE_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 199}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0050", "speaker_id": "ilyra", "text": "Careful. Reopening it makes `were` correct again.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[EVENING — CROWN GUEST QUARTERS]", "source_speaker_label": "ILYRA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_REST_IN_CAELORA_MORNING_DEPARTURE_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 203}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0051", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "Oh, go fuck yourselves with the same spoon—no, that's logistically impossible unless you take turns. Fine. Take turns. Same spoon.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[EVENING — CROWN GUEST QUARTERS]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_REST_IN_CAELORA_MORNING_DEPARTURE_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 209}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0052", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "Cyanis, help me.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[EVENING — CROWN GUEST QUARTERS]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_REST_IN_CAELORA_MORNING_DEPARTURE_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 213}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0053", "speaker_id": "cyanis", "text": "I'm staying out of this. You were very clear.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[EVENING — CROWN GUEST QUARTERS]", "source_speaker_label": "CYANIS", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_REST_IN_CAELORA_MORNING_DEPARTURE_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 217}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0054", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "I hate consistency when it becomes inconvenient.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[EVENING — CROWN GUEST QUARTERS]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_REST_IN_CAELORA_MORNING_DEPARTURE_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 221}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0055", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "Fine. I am tired. That does not make any of you correct in principle.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[EVENING — CROWN GUEST QUARTERS]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_REST_IN_CAELORA_MORNING_DEPARTURE_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 227}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B14_L0056", "speaker_id": "torren", "text": "Sure.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[EVENING — CROWN GUEST QUARTERS]", "source_speaker_label": "TORREN", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_14_REST_IN_CAELORA_MORNING_DEPARTURE_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 229}},
